reestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"hQSwFQVfSdc","position":3,"timestamp":"00:08:05","rawTrack":"The Big Payback - The Return","track":{"id":"1XUHAer5TZ0","path":"/artists/the-big-payback/tracks/the-return/","slug":"the-return","title":"The Return","artist":{"slug":"the-big-payback","title":"The Big Payback"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-big-payback/tracks/the-return.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-ujRBpLCm6s","slug":"217","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-217-w-iamnobodi"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #217 w/ IAMNOBODI","artwork":"/images/episodes/217.jpg","content":"IAMNOBODI's first-ever live DJ set.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7266,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-07-18T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"hd4oUskfCz0","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Big Payback - The Return","track":{"id":"1XUHAer5TZ0","path":"/artists/the-big-payback/tracks/the-return/","slug":"the-return","title":"The Return","artist":{"slug":"the-big-payback","title":"The Big Payback"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-big-payback/tracks/the-return.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"X9WtMbzy8Ik","slug":"261","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-261/ra.1117166701","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-261"},"state":"published","titl